{"parents": [{"link": "../../", "title": "API Reference"}, {"link": "../", "title": "auth0_api_python"}], "prev": {"link": "../token_utils/", "title": "auth0_api_python.token_utils"}, "next": {"link": "../utils/", "title": "auth0_api_python.utils"}, "title": "auth0_api_python.types", "meta": {}, "body": "<section id=\"module-auth0_api_python.types\">\n<span id=\"auth0-api-python-types\"></span><h1>auth0_api_python.types<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-auth0_api_python.types\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h1>\n<p>Type definitions for auth0-api-python SDK</p>\n<section id=\"attributes\">\n<h2>Attributes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#attributes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolver\" title=\"auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolver\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolver</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Type alias for domains resolver function.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"classes\">\n<h2>Classes<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#classes\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<table class=\"autosummary longtable docutils align-default\">\n<tbody>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim\" title=\"auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ActClaim</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Actor claim carried by access tokens issued through delegation.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext\" title=\"auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Context passed to domains resolver functions.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-odd\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult\" title=\"auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OnBehalfOfTokenResult</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Result returned from an On Behalf Of token exchange.</p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"row-even\"><td><p><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult\" title=\"auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult\"><code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ClientCredentialsTokenResult</span></code></a></p></td>\n<td><p>Result returned from a client credentials (M2M) token request.</p></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section id=\"module-contents\">\n<h2>Module Contents<a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#module-contents\" title=\"Link to this heading\">\u00b6</a></h2>\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ActClaim</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TypedDict</span></code></p>\n<p>Actor claim carried by access tokens issued through delegation.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim.sub\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">sub</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim.sub\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The current actor for this step of the delegation chain.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim.act\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">act</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim.act\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The prior actor in the delegation chain, if present.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id0\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">sub</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id0\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id1\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">act</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim\" title=\"auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim\"><span class=\"pre\">ActClaim</span></a></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id1\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TypedDict</span></code></p>\n<p>Context passed to domains resolver functions.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.request_url\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">request_url</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.request_url\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The URL the API request was made to (optional)</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.request_headers\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">request_headers</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.request_headers\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Request headers dict (e.g., Host, X-Forwarded-Host) (optional)</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.unverified_iss\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">unverified_iss</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.unverified_iss\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The issuer claim from the unverified token</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id2\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">request_url</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id2\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id3\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">request_headers</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">dict</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">|</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">None</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id3\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id4\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">unverified_iss</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id4\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">OnBehalfOfTokenResult</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TypedDict</span></code></p>\n<p>Result returned from an On Behalf Of token exchange.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.access_token\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.access_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The access token issued for the downstream API.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.expires_in\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_in</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.expires_in\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Token lifetime in seconds.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.expires_at\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_at</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.expires_at\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Absolute expiration time as a Unix timestamp in seconds, calculated by the SDK from expires_in.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.scope\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">scope</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.scope\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Granted scopes, if returned by Auth0.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.token_type\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">token_type</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.token_type\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Token type, if returned by Auth0.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.issued_token_type\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">issued_token_type</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.issued_token_type\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>RFC 8693 issued token type, if returned by Auth0.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id5\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id5\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id6\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_in</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id6\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id7\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_at</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id7\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id8\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">scope</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id8\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id9\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">token_type</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id9\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id10\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">issued_token_type</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id10\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py class\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult\">\n<em class=\"property\"><span class=\"pre\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span></em><span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">ClientCredentialsTokenResult</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Bases: <code class=\"xref py py-obj docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">TypedDict</span></code></p>\n<p>Result returned from a client credentials (M2M) token request.</p>\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.access_token\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.access_token\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The access token issued for the target API.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.expires_in\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_in</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.expires_in\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Token lifetime in seconds.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.expires_at\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_at</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.expires_at\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Absolute expiration time as a Unix timestamp in seconds, calculated by the SDK from expires_in.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.scope\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">scope</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.scope\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Granted scopes, if returned by Auth0.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.token_type\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">token_type</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ClientCredentialsTokenResult.token_type\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Token type, if returned by Auth0.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id11\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">access_token</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id11\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id12\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_in</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id12\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id13\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">expires_at</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">int</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id13\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id14\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">scope</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id14\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py attribute\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"id15\">\n<span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">token_type</span></span><em class=\"property\"><span class=\"p\"><span class=\"pre\">:</span></span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"pre\">str</span></em><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#id15\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd></dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class=\"py data\">\n<dt class=\"sig sig-object py\" id=\"auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolver\">\n<span class=\"sig-prename descclassname\"><span class=\"pre\">auth0_api_python.types.</span></span><span class=\"sig-name descname\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolver</span></span><a class=\"headerlink\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolver\" title=\"Link to this definition\">\u00b6</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Type alias for domains resolver function.</p>\n<p>A DomainsResolver is a sync or async function that receives a DomainsResolverContext\nand returns a list of allowed domain strings.</p>\n<dl class=\"field-list simple\">\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Parameters<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p><strong>context</strong> (<a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext\" title=\"auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext\"><em>DomainsResolverContext</em></a>) \u2013 Dictionary containing:\n- \u2018request_url\u2019 (str | None): The URL the API request was made to\n- \u2018request_headers\u2019 (dict | None): Request headers (e.g., Host, X-Forwarded-Host)\n- \u2018unverified_iss\u2019 (str): The issuer claim from the unverified token</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-even\">Returns<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-even\"><p>List of allowed domain strings (e.g., [\u2018tenant.auth0.com\u2019])</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class=\"field-odd\">Return type<span class=\"colon\">:</span></dt>\n<dd class=\"field-odd\"><p>list[str]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n<dl>\n<dt>Example (sync):</dt><dd><p>from auth0_api_python import DomainsResolverContext</p>\n<dl>\n<dt>def my_resolver(context: DomainsResolverContext) -&gt; list[str]:</dt><dd><p>host = (context.get(\u2018request_headers\u2019) or {}).get(\u2018host\u2019)\nif host == \u2018api.brand.com\u2019:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<div><p>return [\u2018brand.custom-domain.com\u2019]</p>\n</div></blockquote>\n<p>return [\u2018tenant.auth0.com\u2019]</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd>\n<dt>Example (async):</dt><dd><dl class=\"simple\">\n<dt>async def my_async_resolver(context: DomainsResolverContext) -&gt; list[str]:</dt><dd><p>domains = await db.lookup_domains(context[\u2018unverified_iss\u2019])\nreturn domains</p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</section>\n</section>\n", "metatags": "<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\" />\n", "rellinks": [["genindex", "General Index", "I", "index"], ["py-modindex", "Python Module Index", "", "modules"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/utils/index", "auth0_api_python.utils", "N", "next"], ["autoapi/auth0_api_python/token_utils/index", "auth0_api_python.token_utils", "P", "previous"]], "sourcename": "autoapi/auth0_api_python/types/index.rst.txt", "toc": "<ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#\">auth0_api_python.types</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#attributes\">Attributes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#classes\">Classes</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#module-contents\">Module Contents</a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ActClaim</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim.sub\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ActClaim.sub</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.ActClaim.act\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ActClaim.act</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#id0\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ActClaim.sub</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#id1\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">ActClaim.act</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.request_url\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext.request_url</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.request_headers\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext.request_headers</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.DomainsResolverContext.unverified_iss\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext.unverified_iss</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#id2\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext.request_url</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#id3\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext.request_headers</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#id4\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">DomainsResolverContext.unverified_iss</span></code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OnBehalfOfTokenResult</span></code></a><ul>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.access_token\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OnBehalfOfTokenResult.access_token</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.expires_in\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OnBehalfOfTokenResult.expires_in</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.expires_at\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OnBehalfOfTokenResult.expires_at</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.scope\"><code class=\"docutils literal notranslate\"><span class=\"pre\">OnBehalfOfTokenResult.scope</span></code></a></li>\n<li><a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"#auth0_api_python.types.OnBehalfOfTokenResult.token_type\"><cod